{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17181","headline":"晨坐寓兴 · 权德舆","name":"晨坐寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨坐虚斋，羣动寂未諠。\n泊然一室内，因见万化源。\n得丧心既齐，清净敎益敦。\n境来每自惬，理胜或不言。\n亭柯见荣枯，止水知清浑。\n悠悠世上人，此理法难论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}